{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Runemaster Fracture scales with attack power and always crits frozen targets (#595)",
  "contract": [
    "Fracture 803018 (Riftblade talent): 'Strike an enemy with frozen fury, dealing ${$m1+0+$AP*1.5} Frost damage and",
    "burning ${$m3+0+$AP*.35} of the target's mana. Damage dealt is guaranteed to critically strike against frozen",
    "targets.' Requires a two-handed melee weapon (subclass mask 0x562) and Stealth (Stances 1 << 29, FORM_STEALTH,",
    "granted by Runeshroud 500288). Effect 0 SCHOOL_DAMAGE, effect 2 POWER_BURN (MiscValue 0 = mana, BasePoints 24 +",
    "DieSides 1 = 25), DmgClass MELEE, school Frost. On main there is no spell_bonus_data row and",
    "EffectBonusMultiplier is 0, so neither attack-power term existed, and nothing forced a critical strike.",
    "Expected: the native damage calculation gains 1.5 per point of attack power (times the caster's percent done",
    "modifiers, about 1); the mana burn value gains 0.35 per point; every Fracture that hits a target frozen by",
    "Frost Nova (AURA_STATE_FROZEN) is a critical strike. The unfrozen crit chance is asserted to be far from",
    "certain, so four crits in four frozen casts are attributable to the frozen rule. The Harvest Golem has no mana,",
    "so the burn is checked as a value."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
  "players": [
    {"id": "rm", "race": 1, "class": 32, "level": 80, "melee_hit_rating": 10000, "expertise_rating": 10000},
    {"id": "mage", "race": 1, "class": 8, "level": 80, "spell_hit_rating": 10000}
  ],
  "creatures": [
    {"id": "enemy", "owner": "rm", "entry": 36, "level": 80, "health": 2000000, "distance": 3}
  ],
  "steps": [
    {"action": "wait", "label": "Let spawn AI settle", "ms": 3000},
    {"action": "learn", "actor": "rm", "spell": 197},
    {"action": "add_item", "actor": "rm", "item": 12784},
    {"action": "equip", "actor": "rm", "item": 12784, "slot": 15},
    {"action": "learn", "actor": "rm", "spell": 803018},
    {"action": "learn", "actor": "mage", "spell": 122},

    {"action": "snapshot", "actor": "rm", "metric": "attack_power", "save_as": "attack_power_before"},
    {"action": "snapshot", "actor": "rm", "metric": "spell_damage_done", "spell": 803018, "target": "enemy",
